1. Different subsets are joined with different points;
2. All joined points are vertices of a regular polygon;
3. If $A_1, A_2, \dots, A_k$ are some of the joined points, $k > 2$, such that $A_1A_2 \dots A_k$ is a regular $k$-gon, then 2014 divides $S(\mathcal{A}_1)^2 + S(\mathcal{A}_2)^2 + \dots + S(\mathcal{A}_k)^2$?

