Find all positive integers $n$ such that there exist $n$ real numbers $a_1, a_2, \dots, a_n$ in $[-4, 2]$ satisfying the following:
- $\sum_{i=1}^n a_i \ge n$;
- $\sum_{i=1}^n a_i^2 \le 4n$;
- $\sum_{i=1}^n a_i^4 \ge 34n$.

