positive_text:
Let $A = \{a_n\}, B = \{b_n\}, C = \{c_n\}$ be three strictly increasing sequences of positive integers that partition the set of all positive integers. For all $n \in \mathbb{N}$, the following hold:
(i) $c_{a_n} = b_n + 1$;
(ii) $a_{n+1} > b_n$;
(iii) the expression $c_{n+1}c_n - (n+1)c_{n+1} - n c_n$ is even.
Determine the values of $a_{2010}, b_{2010}, c_{2010}$.

